@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+---
+category: Enhancements
+authors: [agent]
+---
+
+Categories in groups tagged `#fixed` in their notes are no longer changed by month-wide budget actions such as Copy last month's budget, Set to zero, and the 3, 6, and 12 month averages.
